@startuml
title Storyteller Flow Design

start

:AssistantApp uses AppConfigLoader to build AppConfig and app context;

:AssistantApp boots terminal UI;

:Read user input;

if (exit command?) then (yes)

  stop

else (no)

  :AssistantApp delegates turn to StorySessionService;

  :PromptResourceLoader loads raw prompt files;

  :PromptTemplateService formats reusable prompt fragments;

  :PromptAssemblyService coordinates prompt builders;

  :StoryChatPromptBuilder assembles storyteller prompt stack;

  :Send prompt to LM Studio chat model;

  :Receive candidate story response;

  if (validation enabled?) then (yes)

    :ValidationPromptBuilder builds rules validation request;

    :ValidationClient sends validator request;

    :ValidationDecisionParser extracts ALLOW or REPLACE;

    if (validator returned ALLOW?) then (yes)

      :ResponseSanitizer normalizes visible escapes;

      :Print final response;

    else (no)

      :ResponseSanitizer normalizes replacement text;

      :Use validator replacement text as final response;

    endif

  else (no)

    :Print final response;

  endif

  :Append user turn and response to history;

  :Trigger canonical state refresh if enough older messages exist;

  :Trigger recent summary refresh if enough recent-window messages exist;

  :Trigger long-term summary refresh if enough older messages exist;

  :AssistantApp formats and prints final response;

endif

stop
@enduml
